            <div xml:id="m-2e9a002b-ad03-49ce-9f5c-9646906a8c32">
              <lg xml:id="m-3e86339d-ede9-479e-bd68-ed5ea0119471">
                <l xml:id="m-f28adfff-14c3-439e-8989-4aa4311f43fe" facs="#m-eb3edfde-127d-4f48-87bd-bfd087f286d7" label="text-like">isth Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-dbd04d11-c20a-4770-9985-abcdae1fffde" facs="#m-aa889c0f-e63f-4285-af10-44709462a6f2" label="ambiguous">105e</l><l xml:id="m-9a13be06-1ece-4e8f-b019-5f260a4abadc" facs="#m-5212e3ba-369e-4a1b-bbf0-4f093418176a" label="text-like">The Eighteenth Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-ea51f58c-b35c-4538-bc97-9c4afefb8955" facs="#m-c2132971-336f-456d-886d-7d3894e08ed1" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-84caa19b-dcc0-4f24-8109-dfd7014d575e" facs="#m-4c38936b-1b78-4c3a-88dd-5eefaa0f9a77" label="ambiguous">intr. </l><l xml:id="m-fdae3ef0-42b7-400d-a7e1-1cdcdda15237" facs="#m-6a1c3639-dc04-40dd-ae2d-f98092534a82" label="lyrics-like">A pácem, " Dó- mi- ne, sus-tinéntibus te,</l><l xml:id="m-9fe133d6-f26d-44e1-bc23-9f8ae5298aa7" facs="#m-5daa4e8f-6c4f-4bf3-9b2c-adf4a7d3dce8" label="lyrics-like">fi-dé- les inve- ni-ántur : exáu¬</l><l xml:id="m-92f85be3-b0bd-4070-af0d-290660cb0b00" facs="#m-25945123-9fe4-40fd-9da8-bf3342c31514" label="lyrics-like">ut prophétae tú¬ </l><l xml:id="m-16ebaf50-477c-4739-bf8d-4ad82df3dba5" facs="#m-60c3a062-c055-4527-a04f-87e1d8179331" label="lyrics-like">di pré-ces sérvi tú¬ i, et plébis tú¬ ae Is¬</l><l xml:id="m-23cc1ff0-1608-4aa6-985a-a139fba3898e" facs="#m-01b97d80-2002-4cb3-92b6-84b826154ba9" label="lyrics-like">ra- el. Ps. Laetá-tus sum in his quae dícta sunt mí-hi:</l><l xml:id="m-e133af43-cec2-4f6e-80ea-dd458348f687" facs="#m-bba0a161-4819-4e56-b5e7-aedacbc74be0" label="lyrics-like">in dómum Dómi- ni i-bi-mus. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-04225e32-ef26-45ea-b1dc-dcb5b6d9fad3" facs="#m-735feb70-bfec-41be-a28c-ee682a604608" label="ambiguous">E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-b643da5e-9dae-43c4-9ce4-94a1474dad6d" facs="#m-5fcaf8ac-07a6-4ade-a8ea-1f949b9748fa" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-920df1d7-8168-4918-bfb5-88a5da71c30c" facs="#m-c67c5257-d218-448f-8f6c-ce8b0bccc537" label="lyrics-like">Irigat corda nostra, quaésumus rátio:“quia tibi sine te placére</l><l xml:id="m-d3ef3061-0272-4953-a775-7b094263e1e9" facs="#m-cbb8c651-3785-4fc8-8f6e-a46ef4916ec7" label="lyrics-like">1 Dómine, tuae miseratiónis ope-Inon póssumus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-c824c334-f846-4515-8af3-eb443e76cf1e" facs="#m-f8215cfd-7a90-48f9-ac9e-d64d3beff53a" label="text-like">2. A cunctis. p. 498. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-e48d1c22-c042-47c9-8469-5a570b831fe9" facs="#m-0c166426-14f0-4a11-8142-f1ac52004521" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Corinthios. r. Cor. 1.</l><l xml:id="m-0096665e-5717-4de0-9fc2-9249ba8acd98" facs="#m-41171681-ec8b-4ed5-87c6-0dc11d4e394f" label="lyrics-like">LRatres: Grátias ago Deo meol nihil vobis desit in ulla grátia, ex¬</l><l xml:id="m-ff7c8126-af86-4b6d-b270-b7db39738fbc" facs="#m-005c9d64-d8ed-416c-88d0-66185f847e1f" label="lyrics-like">semper pro vobis in grátia Dei,</l><l xml:id="m-223b0d0a-a596-4d99-bf9a-fc530a40e37e" facs="#m-24554fa9-a0f4-4ae9-8e8d-9fbd98895788" label="lyrics-like">spectántibus revelatiónem Dómini</l><l xml:id="m-14aed024-f905-41e4-a0c8-64a47bf576c7" facs="#m-6b7f84f3-e369-410f-85a1-e827930fb305" label="ambiguous">nostri Jesu Christi, qui et confir¬</l><l xml:id="m-f746302c-ddf8-445e-b238-761a8c6233ec" facs="#m-b9f0133d-bf74-4c8e-bb16-534d69ae4925" label="ambiguous">quae data est vobis in Christo Jesu:</l><l xml:id="m-fb1b2ddb-e5b2-49f1-9944-2135376a40e5" facs="#m-bc46e84d-a176-48d9-9227-0acdb31d8153" label="lyrics-like">quod in ómnibus dívites facti estis</l><l xml:id="m-ba1eb618-6303-48f6-882e-e005d74c2843" facs="#m-1959c329-4f9e-485b-8dad-67e19572f904" label="lyrics-like">mábit vos usque in finem sine crí¬</l><l xml:id="m-252a4b5a-cb20-4c66-b3c7-bca8221d7420" facs="#m-186e56d5-1415-43dc-add7-63360b63eaaf" label="ambiguous">in illo, in omni verbo, et in omni</l><l xml:id="m-b6682345-c21d-41aa-8bf4-70aedd93e581" facs="#m-22a4462d-613e-4b6d-bb7b-a279628d752f" label="lyrics-like">mine, in die advéntus Dómini nostri</l><l xml:id="m-dd8a5256-a28b-4e71-a76d-d2dda5d7f55b" facs="#m-5a5c5a6d-0cb6-4bc2-afd2-104b0362a434" label="lyrics-like">sciéntia: sicut testimónium Christi</l><l xml:id="m-6823f157-d981-4616-8fd5-d3aaa087c0d9" facs="#m-45d5e073-2aea-4049-a15e-f6589c2ad958" label="ambiguous">Jesu Christi.</l><l xml:id="m-e667f02c-cd49-46ca-94fb-d1516b85e643" facs="#m-04269f19-8eea-4d0f-b574-cb6dfb847a19" label="lyrics-like">confirmátum est in vobis: ita ut</l><l xml:id="m-49da418e-2f24-4a73-9917-1cb7982decd0" facs="#m-04c5473a-8b76-49b0-9832-bbe1f4046cf7" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Laetátus sum. D. 560.</l><l xml:id="m-defb8a1e-7978-45d2-b993-bfa5362b43d6" facs="#m-1a83ac10-ed90-4b5f-b8d0-c82a1b0b9b72" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-43411e5c-50ce-49d6-9207-c8010cee0aec" facs="#m-cf4dbde8-b4f8-4a21-a404-d2d29ce8375e" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-7b89a38f-cfcd-4def-8626-892c6cade7a5" facs="#m-f626b381-970d-4fd8-a308-ea222453ec11" label="lyrics-like">L- le- lú¬a—ij</l></lg>
            </div>
